        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1220/7 Decorative Floral Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis 7\" decorative flower design cabinet handle is available in 6 different finishes to compliment your cabinet doors. The highly detailed design is impeccably crafted from solid forged brass. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: With Flower Roses <a href=\"/products/flower-cabinet-handle-with-flower-roses-first-impressions-122029kr-7\"><b>First Impressions 122029KR Flower Cabinet Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFirst Impressions is the decorator's choice for high quality innovational designed door and cabinet hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe floral design matches First Impressions <a href=\"/products/decorative-floral-cabinet-knob-first-impressions-1229k\"><b>1229K Floral Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/17-inch-castle-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-svy875017sbr\"><b>1229/1/17 Refrigerator Door Pull</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 1220/7 Cabinet Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 4-1/4\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
